{
  "slug": "agentic-council",
  "name": "Agentic Council",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Convene a team of specialist agents out of a 20-agent roster in a 3-round deliberation council on your hardest engineering decisions. Walk away with a unified design and a phased build plan.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **66 skills**, **38 agents** and **9 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (66): `advocate-a11y-audit` (Use when auditing accessibility compliance of a feature or codebase), `advocate-i18n-review` (Use when reviewing internationalization readiness of a feature or codebase), `advocate-interaction-design` (Use when designing component interaction specs with visual states, transitions, and accessibility requirements), `advocate-journey-mapping` (Use when mapping complete user journeys through multi-step flows, onboarding sequences, or feature workflows), `alchemist-ml-workflow` (Use when designing end-to-end ML workflows), `alchemist-pipeline-design` (Use when designing data pipelines for moving, transforming, and delivering data), `alchemist-schema-evaluation` (Use when evaluating or designing data warehouse schemas for analytical workloads), `architect-api-design` (Use when designing REST or RPC endpoint contracts with request/response types and error handling), and 58 more\n- **Agents** (38): `council-advocate` (Council Green Lens — user experience, product thinking, accessibility), `council-alchemist` (Council Indigo Lens — data engineering, data science, ML workflows, analytics), `council-architect` (Council Blue Lens — system design, data models, APIs, integration patterns), `council-artisan` (Council Rose Lens — visual design, design systems, motion), `council-chronicler` (Council Ivory Lens — documentation, knowledge architecture, onboarding), `council-cipher` (Council Obsidian Lens — cryptographic engineering, protocol security, key management, post-quantum readiness), `council-craftsman` (Council Purple Lens — DX, testing strategy, code quality, patterns), `council-guardian` (Council Silver Lens — compliance, governance, privacy), and 30 more\n- **Commands** (9): `_council-engine`, `brainstorm` (Quick 3-agent gut check — fast takes from Architect, Advocate, Skeptic), `council` (Big Ideas Multi-Agent Workflow — interview, design, plan, build), `deepen` (Codebase architecture review — find shallow modules, tight coupling, and deepening opportunities), `finance-council` (Finance Council — multi-agent deliberation for finance, audit, FP&A, tax, and treasury decisions), `handover` (Save session knowledge — decisions, pitfalls, and next steps — for the next Claude session), `people-council` (People Council — multi-agent deliberation for talent, performance, comp, L&D, DEI, and people-ops decisions), `revenue-council` (Revenue Council — multi-agent deliberation for sales, customer success, support, RevOps, and partnerships decisions), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agentic-council@claude-community` from `dtsong/agentic-council`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
